--! A platform added to beni from outside its source tree
--! (`docs/design/boundary.md` §9.5): `zig build -Dplatform=tests/platforms/toy`
--! compiles its `toy` markup lowering into the binary, and a program built
--! for it prints what that lowering made of its view. It exists to prove the
--! external path, and `tests/blackbox/external_platform_test.zig` drives it.

import Html exposing (Html)


pub foreign type Program


--| A program that prints the view: legal, because this platform names the
--| lowering whose markup it reads (`boundary.md` §9.3).
pub foreign show : Html msg -> Program
